  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIP: Health related procurement-Phase-II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Initiation Plan (PIP) outlines UNDPs support to the Ministry of Health and Social Protection of the Population of the Republic of Tajikistan (MOHSPP RT) for procuring and delivering medical products to combat Human Immunodeficiency Virus (HIV). This contributes on enhancing antiretroviral therapy (ART) access and HIV treatment outcomes for People Living with HIV (PLHIV) in Tajikistan with a focus on procurement and delivery of health products (including antiretroviral drugs - ARVs</narrative>
  </description>
